    "detailed_description": "STAR SALVAGER is inspired by vintage arcade classics from the '80s...<br><br>Let us take you back to a happier time... when everything was neon... and video game consoles were the size of refrigerators. <br> <br>FEATURES:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Original combo-making - think <i>TETRIS </i> meets <i>BREAKDANCING IN SPACE</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/cb08dc0602ce477e8bdabca903826105.poster.avif?t=1715255743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/cb08dc0602ce477e8bdabca903826105.webm?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/cb08dc0602ce477e8bdabca903826105.mp4?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> SPACE INVADERS combat. SO wicked excellent.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/e2852564bd24ab4cab62f9269e2a01d6.poster.avif?t=1715255743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/e2852564bd24ab4cab62f9269e2a01d6.webm?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/e2852564bd24ab4cab62f9269e2a01d6.mp4?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Randomly generated maps.  Each run is CRAZY different. (Okay not that different)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/4a3ec44b60d367249c0cb0e7a672405a.poster.avif?t=1715255743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/4a3ec44b60d367249c0cb0e7a672405a.webm?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/4a3ec44b60d367249c0cb0e7a672405a.mp4?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br></li><li>A roguelite metagame to keep you grinding for morsels of progress 'til you can\u2019t remember what day it is. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/ae8587282d2a39753ee1879b720341d8.poster.avif?t=1715255743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/ae8587282d2a39753ee1879b720341d8.webm?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/ae8587282d2a39753ee1879b720341d8.mp4?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br></li><li>Mildly entertaining dialogue by 2d characters who don\u2019t move their lips.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/8200cfbe1fc9b5510886c066ea569a7e.poster.avif?t=1715255743\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/8200cfbe1fc9b5510886c066ea569a7e.webm?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563460/extras/8200cfbe1fc9b5510886c066ea569a7e.mp4?t=1715255743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A killer synth soundtrack that\u2019s worth the price of the game right there.<br><br>WARNING:  Side-effects may include uncontrollable disco dancing, embarrassing voice acting, and the occasional 